              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "موجة حر (mawjat ḥarr) is built from two native Arabic words: mawja, \"a wave\", on the root m-w-j (Lane), and ḥarr, \"heat\", on ḥ-r-r (Lane)."
            }
          ]
        },
